\newlabel{fig:reweighting}{{6}{10}{Johnson's algorithm reweighting process. The left panel shows the original graph with positive edges (blue) and negative edges (red). The right panel displays the reweighted graph where all edges have non-negative weights, with h() values calculated for each node}{figure.6}{}}
