\newlabel{fig:bellman-ford}{{7}{11}{Bellman-Ford shortest paths computation from node A. The left panel shows the original graph with positive edges (blue) and negative edges (red). The right panel displays the computed shortest path distances from node A to all other nodes in the graph. Green nodes indicate reachable nodes with their shortest path distances}{figure.7}{}}
