\newlabel{fig:performance-analysis}{{8}{12}{Performance comparison of Johnson's algorithm, Bellman-Ford algorithm, and Dijkstra's algorithm across graphs with varying numbers of nodes. The horizontal axis represents the number of nodes in the graph, while the vertical axis shows the execution time in seconds}{figure.8}{}}
